@baseUrl = http://localhost:5169

### 1. Get All Skills (any user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 2. Create a new Skill (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Comfortable with Linux CLI",
  "description": "Learn basic bash commands, file navigation, and permissions.",
  "status": 0
}

### 3. Create Another Skill (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Git Fundamentals",
  "description": "Master git clone, commit, push, pull, and branching."
}

### 4. Add Prerequisite (Skill 2 requires Skill 1) (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/2/prerequisites
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1
}

### 5. Check if Skill 1 can be started (any user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/canStart/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6. Check if Skill 2 can be started (should be locked) (any user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/canStart/2
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 7. Get Skill Logs (any user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/1/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8. Add a Skill Log (any user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/1/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Completed the Linux file system navigation section.",
  "amount": 45
}

### 9. Get Unlocked Skills (any user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/unlocked
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10. Get Completed Skills (any user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/completed
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 11. Get Recommended Skills (Top Priorities) (any user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/recommended
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 12. Edit Skill 1 (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/editSkill/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Comfortable with Linux CLI",
  "description": "Updated: basic bash commands, navigation, not using the mouse",
  "metric": "hours"
}

### 13. Remove Prerequisite (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/deletePrerequisite/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Delete Skill 2 (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/deleteSkill/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin-only rejection checks (regular user should get 403 on all)

### 15. Create Skill as regular user - expected to fail (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Should Not Be Created",
  "description": "This request should be rejected."
}

### 16. Add Prerequisite as regular user - expected to fail (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/1/prerequisites
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1
}

### 17. Edit Skill as regular user - expected to fail (403)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/editSkill/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Should Not Be Edited",
  "description": "",
  "metric": ""
}

### 18. Delete Skill as regular user - expected to fail (403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/deleteSkill/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 19. Remove Prerequisite as regular user - expected to fail (403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/deletePrerequisite/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}